  "goodToKnow": "Das Markenzeichen is a trademark or logo (der Mercedes-Stern, das Adidas-Logo with three stripes) and figuratively someone's signature feature: Die Raute (diamond hand gesture) war Merkels Markenzeichen. Die Marke means brand, and also postage stamp (Briefmarke) and the old Deutsche Mark. The legal term for a registered trademark is die eingetragene Marke. Plural: die Markenzeichen."
